\ Heritability reference for predictmeans::heritability() (R/heritability.R).
\ Please save the whole Output window (File > Save) and send that file; the
\ first run may need small syntax fixes (VHERITABILITY may not exist in older
\ versions: then delete those lines; the average variances of differences of
\ the REML means are enough).
\
\ Data A: 20 genotypes (gen) in 4 blocks (blk), 15 of the 80 plots deleted
\ (65 left), simulated. Data B: 30 half-sib families (fam) in 6 blocks, plots
\ of 4 trees (720 trees), simulated.
\
\ R values (lme4 REML), to compare:
\  A: variance components gen 4.37320, blk 0.364362, residual 3.40056
\     average variance of differences of genotype BLUPs (gen random) 1.75987
\       -> Cullis H2 = 1 - 1.75987/(2 x 4.37320) = 0.79879
\     average variance of differences of genotype BLUEs (gen fixed)  2.21170
\       -> Piepho H2 = 4.37320/(4.37320 + 2.21170/2) = 0.79817
\     standard H2 (harmonic mean of plots per genotype) 0.79827
\  B: components fam 0.527737, fam.blk 0.647563, blk 0.233131, residual 3.89882
\     single-tree narrow-sense h2 = 4 x 0.527737/(0.527737 + 0.647563 + 3.89882) = 0.41602

